OL,3,AIconic Australian band Powderfinger
OL,4,Aannounce first tour in 17 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FPowderfinger, one of Australia's best
OL,7,Floved rock bands, has unveiled details
OL,8,Fof a comeback tour ` to take place 17
OL,9,Fyears after they broke up.
OL,11,FThe Brisbane-based group, who confirmed
OL,12,Ftheir reunion last week, will kick off
OL,13,Fwith four nights in their home city
OL,14,Fnext September.
OL,16,FThey will then play another 14 shows
OL,17,Facross Cairns, Sydney, Adelaide, Perth
OL,18,Fand Melbourne, with all gigs to be
OL,19,Fstaged in a "stadium sized big-top"
OL,20,Ftent.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
